       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. ROUNDED-DEMO.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 PRICE       PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE 19.99.
       01 RATE        PIC 9V999 VALUE 0.075.
       01 TAX-TRUNC   PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE 0.
       01 TAX-ROUND   PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE 0.
       01 WHOLE       PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           COMPUTE TAX-TRUNC = PRICE * RATE
           COMPUTE TAX-ROUND ROUNDED = PRICE * RATE
           COMPUTE WHOLE ROUNDED = PRICE
           DISPLAY "TRUNCATED: " TAX-TRUNC
           DISPLAY "ROUNDED:   " TAX-ROUND
           DISPLAY "WHOLE:     " WHOLE
           STOP RUN.
